 "headline": "Da Klaw's Pickups Are Doing The Heavy Lifting",
 "notes": [
  "theInfamous just flipped OREB and DREB away from Da Don Da Beard & Da Klaw, and still sits 12th on the night. Congratulations on the participation trophy.",
  "Franz Wagner dropped 27 points, 8 boards and 11 assists for Gopher Gold, who flipped 3PTM from Suggs to be you and now lead 8-3.",
